# Secrets and approval

- Keep credentials in `config.py` / env. Do not paste into docs or chat.
- Do not run stock sync, database sync from ProductExport, or live tag/PDF runs that write `output/` / overwrite `data/` unless the supervisor already said **yes / do it / fill / run**. Prefer `--dry-run` when the script supports it.
